AI City Problem Predictor - Setup

1. Download app.py from ChatGPT.
2. In VS Code, open your existing AI_City_Problem_Predictor folder.
3. Make a backup of your current app.py (for example, app_old.py).
4. Copy the downloaded app.py into the project folder and replace the old app.py.
5. Keep city_model.pkl, city_data.csv, and train_model.py in the same folder.
6. Open VS Code Terminal (Terminal > New Terminal).
7. Run: python app.py
8. Open http://localhost:8000 in your browser.

If port 8000 is already in use, stop the old server with Ctrl+C before running again.